00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:10.910
Ready?

125
00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:11.350
Okay.

126
00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:12.630
I wrote a pilot.

127
00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:18.070
I had it start with a big old flashback, and I got it back from my professor, and he

128
00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:19.970
was like, you cheated at the top.

129
00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.010
The flashback was a cheat.

130
00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:23.570
Tell the story.

131
00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:24.790
Hmm.

132
00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.970
And I was like, well, damn it.

