00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:52.610
Now, here's something I found interesting about clip shows.

143
00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:59.370
I guess they are often run before a series finale as a way to remind viewers about the

144
00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:05.350
